      en: ["Consecrated in 1764 as a parish for the common people.", "Located in the historic Santa Ana neighborhood.", "The plaza was the site of major political rallies in the 19th and 20th centuries.", "Known for its beautiful wooden altarpieces.", "Survived various fires that affected the surrounding district.", "A National Historic Monument since 1980.", "Features a distinctive colonial bell tower.", "The church reflects the growth of the city outside the original walls."]
