      en: ["Official name is Santa Maria la Antigua, patroness of Panama.", "Construction took 108 years to complete.", "The bell towers are decorated with mother-of-pearl.", "Houses the remains of several Panamanian presidents and bishops.", "Site of the 1903 declaration of the Republic of Panama.", "A UNESCO World Heritage site and National Historic Monument.", "Underwent a massive $12 million restoration in 2018.", "Features a historic pipe organ and 67 stained glass windows."]
